        "An S-Corporation generally becomes more attractive as business revenue or business income grows.",
        "The document states that an S-Corporation in New York City could result in slightly higher taxes than a sole proprietorship.",
        "The operating state affects the comparison between a sole proprietorship and an S-Corporation.",
        "The operating city affects the comparison between a sole proprietorship and an S-Corporation.",
        "Expected annual business income affects the comparison between a sole proprietorship and an S-Corporation.",
        "The importance of liability protection affects the comparison between a sole proprietorship and an S-Corporation.",
        "The available information does not permit a determination of the preferred business structure for the business owner.",
        "The preferred business structure cannot be determined without the operating state, operating city, expected annual business income, and desired level of liability protection."
    ]
}
